WEBVTT

00:00:27.550 --> 00:00:28.510
Hisae...

00:00:29.250 --> 00:00:30.220
Why?

00:00:31.150 --> 00:00:32.910
Let's say good-bye... quietly.

00:00:33.450 --> 00:00:34.680
But... it's so cruel.

00:00:35.150 --> 00:00:36.310
Absolutely cruel!

00:00:47.930 --> 00:00:49.870
Hisae... what happened?

00:00:52.240 --> 00:00:54.870
Does this have anything
to do with "that" incident?

00:00:58.180 --> 00:01:02.040
I don't believe you
were killed by accident.

00:01:02.750 --> 00:01:04.810
Hisae, tell me.

00:01:04.980 --> 00:01:05.970
What happened?

00:01:49.930 --> 00:01:55.090
Shinma are supernatural beings
that devour the hearts of men...

00:01:55.730 --> 00:01:58.860
...and lead them to ruin.

00:02:00.510 --> 00:02:04.940
Long ago, they were
sealed in the Dark World.

00:02:06.140 --> 00:02:09.670
However, there
are stray Shinma...

00:02:10.550 --> 00:02:12.880
...that live secretly
in the human world.

00:02:13.890 --> 00:02:16.550
They lurk in the division
between night and day.

00:02:18.360 --> 00:02:23.450
The Guardian who sends the stray
Shinma back to the Dark World...

00:02:24.330 --> 00:02:28.860
...is the beautiful vampire, Miyu.

00:02:30.070 --> 00:02:33.300
No one knows her true face.

00:03:00.200 --> 00:03:01.170
Miyu?

00:03:01.630 --> 00:03:02.900
Hisae and I witnessed...

00:03:03.200 --> 00:03:04.830
...Miyu coming
out of the mirror.

00:03:05.840 --> 00:03:08.100
She didn't look human.

00:03:08.470 --> 00:03:09.840
Don't say such
a ridiculous thing!

00:03:10.080 --> 00:03:11.870
Miyu is my friend!

00:03:12.540 --> 00:03:16.640
She was your friend,
but I don't know about now.

00:03:17.450 --> 00:03:19.880
Yukari? Are you
suspicious of Miyu?

00:03:20.490 --> 00:03:21.750
I don't want to be.

00:03:21.820 --> 00:03:22.790
Yukari!

00:03:23.190 --> 00:03:25.280
I'm gonna get mad at you,
in spite of our friendship!

00:03:25.760 --> 00:03:26.720
But actually...

00:03:26.790 --> 00:03:28.950
...Miyu has been absent
from school ever since then.

00:03:29.060 --> 00:03:30.290
The timing seems
a little too good.

00:03:31.360 --> 00:03:32.990
It has to be nothing
more than a coincidence.

00:03:33.470 --> 00:03:35.490
I'll never believe you!

00:03:36.200 --> 00:03:37.460
Do whatever
you wish, Chisato.

00:03:38.070 --> 00:03:41.630
But I'm convinced that
Miyu is involved somehow.

00:03:42.070 --> 00:03:43.600
I hate you, Yukari!

00:03:44.610 --> 00:03:47.200
You didn't used
to get mad so easily.

00:03:47.580 --> 00:03:48.940
After you met Miyu...

00:03:49.750 --> 00:03:50.940
...you changed, Chisato.

00:03:51.420 --> 00:03:52.580
I don't know about that!

00:03:52.950 --> 00:03:54.710
Yukari, I'm not gonna
talk to you anymore!

00:03:55.290 --> 00:03:56.250
Whatever you like...

00:04:00.090 --> 00:04:01.290
But what about Hisae?

00:04:12.640 --> 00:04:15.660
Miyu, why are you not here
at such a difficult time?

00:04:16.610 --> 00:04:19.200
Hisae is dead and Yukari
is saying such ridiculous things...

00:04:20.350 --> 00:04:23.110
Well, Miyu, are you
really hiding something?

00:04:23.880 --> 00:04:26.440
I thought we were best friends...
We promised...

00:04:41.700 --> 00:04:42.670
How come?

00:04:57.980 --> 00:04:59.810
They say someone used
a needle or something...

00:04:59.890 --> 00:05:01.820
...to suck the blood
out of Hisae's body.

00:05:02.390 --> 00:05:05.080
The police think it was
done by a psychopath.

00:05:07.330 --> 00:05:08.490
But Hisae was...

00:05:12.700 --> 00:05:15.060
I went to see
Miho and Sone...

00:05:15.530 --> 00:05:17.830
...to find out
how they were doing.

00:05:19.070 --> 00:05:20.040
Are they... still ill?

00:05:20.210 --> 00:05:21.170
Yes.

00:05:21.910 --> 00:05:26.000
Then I noticed that there was
a little cut in Miho's neck.

00:05:26.380 --> 00:05:28.470
It was as if she was
poked with something there...

00:05:28.850 --> 00:05:29.810
Also...

00:05:30.420 --> 00:05:31.850
You saw the same
thing on Sone, didn't you?

00:05:33.150 --> 00:05:34.210
So, what do you think, Hisae?

00:05:34.720 --> 00:05:37.150
I don't know for sure yet,
but I'm still looking into it.

00:05:37.420 --> 00:05:38.410
You mean... Miyu?

00:05:38.790 --> 00:05:40.220
I don't know
about her yet, either.

00:05:40.730 --> 00:05:42.960
So please don't
say anything to Chisato.

00:05:43.160 --> 00:05:44.130
I know...

00:05:44.700 --> 00:05:47.320
...because Chisato
is really fond of Miyu.

00:05:51.670 --> 00:05:52.640
A scar on the neck...

00:05:53.210 --> 00:05:55.540
...and the book on vampires
that Hisae was reading...

00:05:56.270 --> 00:05:58.400
Hisae, I've started
to understand more...

00:05:59.210 --> 00:06:00.770
...about what
you were thinking.

00:06:03.080 --> 00:06:04.780
But how could
such a thing be real...

00:06:05.720 --> 00:06:07.620
Miyu, where are you?

00:06:07.950 --> 00:06:10.650
Hisae said that Miyu's address
was here in this cemetery.

00:06:12.520 --> 00:06:16.050
If it's true,
please come out... Miyu.

00:06:25.400 --> 00:06:27.430
Yukari...
she must be lonely.

00:06:28.010 --> 00:06:29.630
Are you going to look
for the killer?

00:06:30.180 --> 00:06:31.940
It was probably
done by a Shinma.

00:06:32.440 --> 00:06:33.880
I think you are
reading too much into it.

00:06:33.950 --> 00:06:35.440
I'm sure it was
done by a human.

00:06:35.650 --> 00:06:36.610
Leave it alone.

00:06:37.520 --> 00:06:38.950
Larva, what do you think?

00:06:39.680 --> 00:06:41.120
Whatever
satisfies you, Miyu.

00:06:41.850 --> 00:06:44.650
But we have stayed
in this town too long.

00:06:46.220 --> 00:06:47.190
I agree.

00:06:48.430 --> 00:06:50.550
What kept you
from leaving?

00:06:52.060 --> 00:06:53.290
I have no idea.

00:06:54.400 --> 00:06:57.060
It's about time.
We shouldn't be here any longer.

00:06:57.140 --> 00:06:58.930
Let's get on the road again.

00:06:59.400 --> 00:07:00.370
That's a good idea.

00:07:01.140 --> 00:07:02.110
But...

00:07:17.460 --> 00:07:20.220
I wish my big
brother was here.

00:07:20.830 --> 00:07:22.620
I wonder why he had
to go back so suddenly.

00:07:32.770 --> 00:07:33.740
I'm home!

00:07:53.890 --> 00:07:55.220
Did you find anything?

00:07:56.330 --> 00:07:57.350
Where have you been?

00:07:57.730 --> 00:08:01.360
I'm also looking
for Hisae's killer.

00:08:01.870 --> 00:08:03.770
Do you mean to tell me
that it's not you?

00:08:04.070 --> 00:08:06.230
Yukari, could you
please let it go?

00:08:06.770 --> 00:08:08.670
This is way
beyond your power.

00:08:09.740 --> 00:08:13.040
I don't want anyone else
to be in danger.

00:08:13.580 --> 00:08:14.770
You didn't
answer my question!

00:08:15.410 --> 00:08:17.440
Miyu, who the hell are you?

00:08:17.650 --> 00:08:20.380
You probably
wouldn't understand.

00:08:20.650 --> 00:08:22.090
What are you
babbling about?

00:08:33.330 --> 00:08:34.260
Come out!

00:08:37.540 --> 00:08:38.500
Miyu, you...

00:08:38.940 --> 00:08:39.900
Are you sure...

00:08:40.070 --> 00:08:44.300
...you want your friend
to see you make such a face?

00:08:49.150 --> 00:08:50.110
Who are you?

00:08:50.750 --> 00:08:52.380
We met...
somewhere, didn't we?

00:08:53.550 --> 00:08:56.110
Thank you very much
for your purchase at that time.

00:08:58.820 --> 00:09:00.310
You certainly haven't
forgotten, have you?

00:09:01.690 --> 00:09:02.660
The friendship...

00:09:02.960 --> 00:09:03.930
...charms.

00:09:13.100 --> 00:09:14.070
Why?

00:09:14.940 --> 00:09:16.870
I didn't feel
you were a Shinma.

00:09:17.610 --> 00:09:18.670
Thanks to that.

00:09:19.480 --> 00:09:21.340
It covers up
our identities.

00:09:22.050 --> 00:09:24.280
That's why I was able
to approach you like this.

00:09:25.080 --> 00:09:26.350
But it's not
necessary anymore.

00:09:33.890 --> 00:09:35.520
Miyu,
what is happening?

00:09:35.590 --> 00:09:36.860
Who the hell is this guy?

00:09:38.360 --> 00:09:39.760
Why don't you
show your true self?

00:09:40.600 --> 00:09:42.900
That's a good idea.
You, too.

00:09:52.040 --> 00:09:55.600
SHIDON

00:10:12.200 --> 00:10:14.430
That's how
a Guardian should be.

00:10:14.900 --> 00:10:15.990
What the hell is this?

00:10:16.630 --> 00:10:18.630
This is our battle.

00:10:26.310 --> 00:10:27.370
Yukari! Run away!

00:10:28.180 --> 00:10:29.150
What's going on?

00:10:29.210 --> 00:10:30.270
Could this guy be...

00:10:30.380 --> 00:10:31.310
Just go! Hurry!

00:10:38.860 --> 00:10:40.120
There are
no more humans.

00:10:40.490 --> 00:10:41.820
Then no need
to waste any more time...

00:10:44.300 --> 00:10:45.560
Larva!

00:10:53.940 --> 00:10:54.910
You're strong.

00:10:56.010 --> 00:10:56.970
What an honor.

00:10:57.510 --> 00:10:59.530
I'd like to talk
with you for a while.

00:11:00.010 --> 00:11:00.980
Sure.

00:11:06.580 --> 00:11:07.550
What the hell is going on?

00:11:07.620 --> 00:11:09.480
That monster...
killed... Hisae?

00:11:09.550 --> 00:11:10.710
Then what about Miyu...

00:11:10.860 --> 00:11:12.380
I don't understand!
Not at all!

00:11:17.200 --> 00:11:19.690
Oh! I need to tell
Chisato right away!

00:11:23.540 --> 00:11:25.500
We can talk quietly here.

00:11:25.770 --> 00:11:26.740
Right.

00:11:26.840 --> 00:11:28.570
There won't be
any interruptions.

00:11:29.110 --> 00:11:30.840
You seem very confident.

00:11:31.410 --> 00:11:32.380
Of course...

00:11:32.610 --> 00:11:35.370
...because this game is
proceeding at my pace.

00:11:35.750 --> 00:11:38.240
Are you saying you
killed Hisae for fun?

00:11:40.050 --> 00:11:41.020
No.

00:11:41.190 --> 00:11:43.550
We don't have time
to pay attention to humans.

00:11:44.020 --> 00:11:45.510
Haven't you
already realized?

00:11:45.760 --> 00:11:47.420
We are birds.

00:11:48.730 --> 00:11:49.890
Our target is you.

00:11:49.990 --> 00:11:51.460
Her death was a lesson.

00:11:52.500 --> 00:11:53.490
What do you mean?

00:11:59.700 --> 00:12:01.000
Chisato! Chisato!

00:12:06.680 --> 00:12:07.650
Yukari?

00:12:07.980 --> 00:12:09.240
What happened?
You're so panicky.

00:12:09.880 --> 00:12:11.610
I don't understand
the whole situation yet myself!

00:12:11.980 --> 00:12:14.470
But Miyu doesn't
seem to be the killer.

00:12:15.150 --> 00:12:16.210
A weird guy
appeared and...

00:12:16.490 --> 00:12:18.050
See? I told you.

00:12:18.390 --> 00:12:19.650
A monster appeared!

00:12:19.960 --> 00:12:21.520
That creature
and Miyu were battling!

00:12:22.360 --> 00:12:23.830
I don't know how to explain...

00:12:24.360 --> 00:12:26.420
It seems complicated,
but why don't you come inside?

00:12:26.830 --> 00:12:28.030
You're soaked with sweat.

00:12:29.030 --> 00:12:30.000
Um... sure...

00:12:36.010 --> 00:12:39.170
We, the Birds, have been
seeking the Guardian.

00:12:39.640 --> 00:12:40.610
You know, don't you?

00:12:41.380 --> 00:12:43.400
Right.
Since ancient days...

00:12:45.380 --> 00:12:47.870
But you didn't show
vulnerability very easily.

00:12:48.520 --> 00:12:50.280
You were very strong.

00:12:50.920 --> 00:12:52.550
Should I say, "Thank you"?

00:12:53.060 --> 00:12:56.690
That's why we decided to create
the strongest Shinma ever...

00:12:57.230 --> 00:12:58.720
...to get you
when you're weak.

00:12:59.760 --> 00:13:01.820
Did you use Chisato's
older brother for that?

00:13:03.670 --> 00:13:06.230
Did you use Chisato
to defeat me?

00:13:11.510 --> 00:13:12.570
What's funny?

00:13:30.560 --> 00:13:31.690
What happened to this room?

00:13:32.000 --> 00:13:34.490
I redecorated it
to match my taste.

00:13:34.870 --> 00:13:36.160
Don't tell me!

00:13:36.700 --> 00:13:40.230
I didn't really know
myself very well until now...

00:13:44.480 --> 00:13:46.600
That's my father and mother!

00:13:48.080 --> 00:13:49.810
I'll introduce them to you.

00:13:53.550 --> 00:13:56.040
Meet my father and mother...

00:13:58.820 --> 00:14:01.720
He was
Chisato's only brother.

00:14:01.890 --> 00:14:04.260
And you used him
to defeat me...

00:14:04.630 --> 00:14:07.430
We weren't
expecting much out of him.

00:14:07.800 --> 00:14:09.270
It was just
to buy more time.

00:14:09.500 --> 00:14:11.490
The strongest Shinma
has already awakened.

00:14:12.440 --> 00:14:13.530
And that is you?

00:14:16.910 --> 00:14:19.900
How can a Guardian
like you be so dumb?

00:14:20.350 --> 00:14:23.680
Why do you think
you were given the key holder?

00:14:24.950 --> 00:14:26.310
It was a blindfold...

00:14:26.380 --> 00:14:27.940
...in the name
of friendship.

00:14:28.120 --> 00:14:29.090
It can't be!

00:14:37.260 --> 00:14:40.530
The strongest Shinma has been
right by your side all along...

00:14:40.830 --> 00:14:42.530
...waiting for the time
to wake up...

00:14:54.410 --> 00:14:55.380
It's summertime.

00:14:56.510 --> 00:14:58.110
Hey, Chisato...

00:14:59.350 --> 00:15:00.610
...about Miyu...

00:15:02.090 --> 00:15:03.610
I really like trees!

00:15:04.460 --> 00:15:05.850
You think so?

00:15:07.830 --> 00:15:08.850
Who are you, mister?

00:15:09.230 --> 00:15:10.720
Let's see...

00:15:11.200 --> 00:15:12.160
I know.

00:15:13.730 --> 00:15:15.130
Are you the one
who sold me this?

00:15:16.530 --> 00:15:18.020
You remember me!

00:15:18.200 --> 00:15:20.400
Yes! Because this is
so special to me.

00:15:21.240 --> 00:15:22.830
But why are you here?

00:15:23.570 --> 00:15:24.800
Do you like trees?

00:15:25.240 --> 00:15:27.840
Yes. I don't
know why, though.

00:15:29.110 --> 00:15:31.380
It's because
you're a bird.

00:15:31.950 --> 00:15:33.750
A bird?
Me?

00:15:34.850 --> 00:15:35.840
What do you mean?

00:15:36.350 --> 00:15:37.320
Let me have it.

00:15:52.870 --> 00:15:53.840
Hey, what
are you doing!?

00:15:54.770 --> 00:15:56.260
Now the seal is broken.

00:16:07.290 --> 00:16:08.680
Is the egg well?

00:16:09.820 --> 00:16:10.790
Yes, it is.

00:16:11.520 --> 00:16:13.550
Then we need to hatch it.

00:16:45.520 --> 00:16:47.320
You've been
a bird all along.

00:16:52.130 --> 00:16:55.000
You really loved
your brother, didn't you?

00:16:55.870 --> 00:16:57.600
Very much.

00:16:59.900 --> 00:17:01.600
Your brother
was also a bird.

00:17:02.010 --> 00:17:03.670
But he is already dead.

00:17:04.080 --> 00:17:05.540
Who do you think did it?

00:17:06.080 --> 00:17:07.040
Who?

00:17:07.710 --> 00:17:08.680
It was Miyu.

00:17:09.510 --> 00:17:12.310
Miyu... my friend?

00:17:12.680 --> 00:17:15.020
Right.
Such a bad friend, isn't she?

00:17:15.720 --> 00:17:17.050
She needs
to be dealt with...

00:17:17.360 --> 00:17:19.080
...before she
does more evil things.

00:17:21.190 --> 00:17:23.960
You have your brother's
keepsake, don't you?

00:17:26.360 --> 00:17:29.090
Use it to kill
your bad friend.

00:17:29.970 --> 00:17:32.370
You've existed all along
for that very purpose.

00:17:34.270 --> 00:17:35.710
I'm supposed
to kill Miyu, right?

00:17:39.540 --> 00:17:41.340
Chisato?
What's wrong?

00:17:41.750 --> 00:17:43.770
I couldn't hear
anything all of a sudden.

00:17:44.450 --> 00:17:46.640
Here is another bad friend.

00:17:48.950 --> 00:17:49.940
Let's try...

00:17:50.490 --> 00:17:51.580
...your power.

00:17:52.590 --> 00:17:54.150
What is this
all about, Chisato?

00:17:55.330 --> 00:17:56.590
What did you tell her?

00:17:56.790 --> 00:17:58.660
Hisae, you don't
need to know anything.

00:17:58.960 --> 00:18:02.560
You'd be happier
if you didn't... forever...

00:18:18.280 --> 00:18:19.540
Job well done.

00:18:21.620 --> 00:18:23.610
Then let's wait
a little longer...

00:18:23.890 --> 00:18:25.950
...until you defeat your
evil friend, your real target.

00:18:49.710 --> 00:18:50.680
Chisato is...

00:18:51.150 --> 00:18:54.020
That's right.
She is the strongest Shinma.

00:18:54.690 --> 00:18:57.810
And that charm was
keeping it from you.

00:18:58.520 --> 00:19:01.510
Why... why did you
choose Chisato?

00:19:02.090 --> 00:19:04.290
She was a Shinma
to begin with.

00:19:04.960 --> 00:19:07.830
She just hadn't
hatched from her egg yet.

00:19:13.070 --> 00:19:15.700
Chisato! What is this?
Explain it to me!

00:19:16.440 --> 00:19:17.410
Well, Yukari.

00:19:18.280 --> 00:19:19.710
We are friends, aren't we?

00:19:20.010 --> 00:19:20.980
What are you saying?

00:19:22.450 --> 00:19:24.380
I still need more power.

00:19:25.020 --> 00:19:27.610
So, could you share
your power with me?

00:19:28.050 --> 00:19:29.020
Don't come near me!

00:19:32.260 --> 00:19:33.250
Yukari...

00:19:33.890 --> 00:19:34.880
I love you very much...

00:19:45.970 --> 00:19:47.440
Larva, take over, please!

00:19:47.740 --> 00:19:48.710
Yes, I will.

00:19:48.770 --> 00:19:50.240
Oops!
Not so soon!

00:19:56.410 --> 00:19:58.040
Now your opponent is... me.

00:19:59.520 --> 00:20:01.420
- Just as I anticipated.
- What?

00:20:01.920 --> 00:20:04.180
My role is
to keep you here.

00:20:04.690 --> 00:20:06.680
She will take care
of the Guardian.

00:20:07.020 --> 00:20:08.180
No!

00:20:11.530 --> 00:20:12.760
Miyu won't be defeated!

00:20:13.330 --> 00:20:14.460
You never know.

00:20:14.570 --> 00:20:17.060
Why do you think
she was placed by Miyu's side?

00:20:18.470 --> 00:20:20.460
Miyu is already her friend.

00:20:21.670 --> 00:20:23.830
A Guardian would
have compassion, too.

00:20:24.710 --> 00:20:27.440
Then I will defeat you first!

00:20:27.650 --> 00:20:29.270
Try it.

00:20:41.460 --> 00:20:42.430
Chisato!

00:20:51.000 --> 00:20:51.970
Miyu...

00:20:55.540 --> 00:20:56.510
You've come for me...

00:20:57.110 --> 00:20:58.080
Chisato...

00:21:01.010 --> 00:21:02.740
The key charms are gone...

00:21:03.450 --> 00:21:05.420
...but aren't
we still friends?

00:21:06.080 --> 00:21:07.050
Forever...

00:21:11.560 --> 00:21:12.520
So...

00:21:13.090 --> 00:21:14.060
...please die...

00:21:14.860 --> 00:21:15.920
...for my sake...

00:21:16.790 --> 00:21:20.090
CHISATO

00:21:57.740 --> 00:22:03.200
The door opens,
and before me is eternity

00:22:03.910 --> 00:22:09.970
Whose voice calls
from so far away?

00:22:10.550 --> 00:22:16.420
Someone smoothes down my hair...
Who are you?

00:22:20.190 --> 00:22:24.060
My flute sings of a land
my heart so wishes for

00:22:24.200 --> 00:22:28.930
Where time
and my feelings pass by

00:22:29.230 --> 00:22:33.030
- I don't want any friends
- That's a lie.

00:22:33.400 --> 00:22:37.200
- I don't even need myself
- It's the truth.

00:22:37.910 --> 00:22:45.680
Footprints I leave behind...
washed away

00:22:49.250 --> 00:22:55.590
The night is mysterious,
it conceals the truth

00:22:56.030 --> 00:23:02.450
Invited by the moon,
darkness spreads through the sky

00:23:04.440 --> 00:23:10.900
The night is violet,
tears fall like rain

00:23:11.510 --> 00:23:17.880
The sky cries for me

00:23:25.520 --> 00:23:30.980
The door opens,
and before me is eternity

00:23:31.600 --> 00:23:37.660
Whose voice calls
from so far away?

00:23:38.240 --> 00:23:44.110
Someone smoothes down my hair...
Who are you?

00:23:47.980 --> 00:23:51.740
My flute sings of a land
my heart so wishes for

00:23:52.020 --> 00:23:56.750
Where time
and my feelings pass by

00:23:57.020 --> 00:24:00.820
- I don't want any friends
- That's a lie.

00:24:01.430 --> 00:24:05.230
- I don't even need myself
- It's the truth.

00:24:06.030 --> 00:24:13.990
Footprints I leave behind...
washed away

00:24:17.310 --> 00:24:23.650
The night is mysterious,
it conceals the truth

00:24:23.910 --> 00:24:30.480
Invited by the moon,
darkness spreads through the sky

00:24:32.420 --> 00:24:38.890
The night is violet,
tears fall like rain

00:24:39.200 --> 00:24:45.570
The sky cries for me

00:24:51.810 --> 00:24:53.970
Did you like your brother?

00:24:54.180 --> 00:24:55.150
Yes.

00:24:55.210 --> 00:24:59.740
I was determined to become
his bride when I grew up!

00:25:00.020 --> 00:25:02.950
But, Chisato...
you'll never grow up.

00:25:03.120 --> 00:25:04.250
That's all the more
reason it was good!

00:25:04.360 --> 00:25:07.050
I could have
dreamed about it forever!

00:25:07.790 --> 00:25:09.220
It was my dream!

00:25:09.590 --> 00:25:11.150
Miyu, you destroyed it!

00:25:13.000 --> 00:25:13.960
So, Miyu...

00:25:14.730 --> 00:25:15.700
Please die...
